{"baseRefName":"beta","body":"## Summary\nEnable all 35 built-in daisyUI themes, classify them into light (21) / dark (14) families, add the `app.css`↔`ThemeFamilies` guard, fix blob + e2e `setTheme` fidelity, build two-layer contrast sweep, update docs.\n\n## Changes\n\n### 1. `resources/css/app.css`\n- Explicit 35-name `themes:` list (no `themes: all` / hybrid) with `fantasy --default` / `luxury --prefersdark`\n- 14 dark selectors in `@custom-variant dark` (the 10 new + 4 existing)\n- Blob chain anchored on `html` with all 14 dark themes in `:not()` lists (additive fix)\n\n### 2. `app/Support/ThemeFamilies.php`\n- `LIGHT` = 21, `DARK` = 14 in daisyUI `themeOrder`\n- 28 new Persian labels per expert comment §4\n- Defaults unchanged\n\n### 3. `tests/Feature/SettingsThemeTest.php`\n- Literals updated to 21/14\n- New `test_enabled_themes_in_app_css_match_theme_families`: parses `themes:` line, asserts set equality with `LIGHT+DARK`, asserts `fantasy --default` / `luxury --prefersdark` flags\n\n### 4. E2E theme fidelity & sweep\n- `theme-helpers.ts`: `THEMES/LIGHT_THEMES/DARK_THEMES` = 35/21/14; `setTheme` now sets `mary-class` (`dark` for dark family, `light` for light) matching real app boot script\n- `BLOCKING_THEMES` = core 7 + `WATCH_THEMES` (9 themes flagged from full sweep)\n- `sweep-runner.ts`: shared 25-surface implementation; `STRUCTURAL` map covers 5 badge-solid cells (all 🧱, #1226); `waitForChart` retry for luxury cold-start flake\n- `sweep.spec.ts`: blocking sweep (9 themes × 25 surfaces) — all ✅/🧱\n- `sweep-35.spec.ts` + `.github/workflows/theme-sweep-35.yml`: full 35×25 matrix (875 rows), report-only, 45-min cap, dispatch + weekly + PR label, job summary + artifact\n\n### 5. `docs/agents/features.md`\n- Rewritten theme section: 35 count, 21/14 split, `app.css` guard, two-layer sweep policy, `mary-class` fidelity\n\n## Verification\n\n| Metric | Before | After | Delta |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| CSS raw | 354.46 kB | 398.94 kB | +44.48 kB |\n| CSS gzip | 44.92 kB | 51.28 kB | +6.36 kB |\n| Flags in built CSS | — | fantasy on `:root` (--color-primary: oklch(37.45% .189 325.02)) ✅ | — |\n| Flags in built CSS | — | luxury in `@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)` (--color-base-100: oklch(14.076% .004 285.822)) ✅ | — |\n\n### Blocking sweep re-baseline vs #1225\n| Theme | Leaflet zoom | Leaflet attribution | Verdict |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| dark | 21.00 → 21.00 | 11.90 → 11.90 | ✅ |\n| synthwave | 1.00 → 21.00 | 1.11 → 11.90 | ✅ (fixed by mary-class) |\n| coffee | 1.00 → 21.00 | 1.11 → 11.90 | ✅ (fixed by mary-class) |\n| luxury | 1.00 → 21.00 | 1.11 → 11.90 | ✅ (fixed by mary-class) |\n\n### Full 35×25 sweep (875 rows)\n- 5 structural 🧱 (badge solid on light/synthwave/fantasy/winter/abyss — needs per-theme badge pairs from #1226)\n- 0 fixable ❌\n- 870 ✅\n- 9 themes in `WATCH_THEMES`: abyss, aqua, autumn, black, corporate, garden, pastel, valentine, winter\n\n## Notes\n- #1226 (per-theme badge pairs) is not merged — badge rows stay 🧱 per fallback clause\n- Badge pairs not invented here\n- `composer test` passes (SettingsThemeTest 9 tests, 238 assertions)\n- `vendor/bin/pint --dirty --format agent` clean\n- `phpstan-baseline.neon` zero new entries\n- `npm run typecheck` clean\n\nCloses #1227","headRefName":"feat/1227-all-daisyui-themes","title":"feat: enable all 35 daisyUI themes with full sweep infrastructure (#1227)","url":"https://github.com/asgarimehdi/h-dashboard/pull/1230"}
